"Eliminatoria decisiva y perdéis 0-3 al descanso. En el vestuario nadie habla y el míster te mira a ti.":"Decisive knockout tie and you're 0-3 down at half-time. Nobody speaks in the dressing room and the manager is looking at you.",
"Eliminatoria igualada tras la prórroga. En la tanda, el míster te pide que lances el quinto penalti, el decisivo. Tienes que dar el paso.":"A tie level after extra time. In the shootout, the manager asks you to take the fifth penalty, the decisive one. You have to step up.",
