"Ellos no fueron mejores. Nos pitaron todo en contra.":"They weren't better. Every call went against us.",
"Ellos tienen toda la presión. Yo solo tengo que tirarme al lado bueno.":"All the pressure is on them. I just have to dive the right way.",
