"Esperáis un bebé y vas a necesitar unas semanas de baja. El club solo ofrece pagar una parte del sueldo durante ese tiempo.":"You're expecting a baby and you'll need a few weeks off. The club only offers to pay part of your salary during that time.",
"Esta es mi gente y es mi equipo. Si por defenderlos me multan, que me multen cien veces.":"These are my people and this is my team. If I get fined for defending them, fine me a hundred times.",
"Esta noche nadie de mi familia me pide nada. Hoy mando yo en casa.":"Tonight nobody in my family gets to ask me for anything. Today I'm the boss at home.",
"Esta semana te mides al {club}, el club que te dejó marchar. Su grada lleva días cantando contra ti. ¿Cómo lo celebrarás si marcas?":"This week you face {club}, the club that let you go. Their fans have been chanting against you for days. How will you celebrate if you score?",
