"Les digo que mañana, entrenamiento a las 7. El que no esté, que busque equipo.":"I tell them training is at 7 tomorrow. Anyone who isn't there can find another team.",
"Les digo que nadie nos regalará nada. Y que esta situación nos pertenece a todos, empezando por mí.":"I tell them nobody will give us anything. And that this situation belongs to all of us, starting with me.",
"Les digo que sonrían. Un equipo que sufre sin disfrutar ya ha perdido. Por lo menos disfrutemos.":"I tell them to smile. A team that suffers without enjoying has already lost. At least let's enjoy it.",
