"Nada especial. Un rival más.":"Nothing special. Just another opponent.",
"Nada me sorprende. Sabía que aquí, con esta gente, los goles iban a llegar.":"Nothing surprises me. I knew that here, with these people, the goals would come.",
"Nada que no sintiera antes. El club me ha dado mucho, y sigo aquí. Bajar o no, seré del club hasta el final.":"Nothing I haven't felt before. The club has given me a lot, and I'm still here. Down or not, I'm with this club to the end.",
"Nada. Cosas del vestuario. Si nos peleamos es porque nos importa. Mañana nos damos un abrazo y listo.":"Nothing. Dressing room stuff. If we fight it's because we care. Tomorrow we hug it out and that's that.",
