"Ni lo sé ni me importa. Yo solo pienso en el domingo.":"I don't know and I don't care. I'm only thinking about Sunday.",
"Ni los rivales pueden con {name} hoy. Qué nivel 😮‍💨":"Not even the opposition can handle {name} today. What a level 😮‍💨",
