"No le sienta bien el tono. Te recuerda quién manda en el vestuario.":"He doesn't like your tone. He reminds you who's in charge in the dressing room.",
"No leo las redes. Ni pienso empezar ahora.":"I don't read social media. And I'm not starting now.",
"No llega el empate.":"The equaliser doesn't come.",
