"No renovar":"Don't renew",
"No se confíen: si se remonta, es porque el rival se relaja. No hay mérito.":"Don't get cocky: if you come back, it's because the opponent switched off. No merit.",
"No se cree tus promesas.":"He doesn't buy your promises.",
