"Senior":"Senior",
"Sentados a la misma mesa, se llega a un acuerdo que contenta a casi todos.":"Sitting at the same table, they reach an agreement that pleases almost everyone.",
"Sentarlos juntos y que se den la mano":"Sit them down and make them shake hands",
"Sentenciada no hay nada. El {rival} no va a regalar un punto y nosotros tampoco.":"Nothing's decided. {rival} won't give away a single point, and neither will we.",
"Septiembre de 2009: Emmanuel Adebayor marcó al Arsenal, su exequipo, y recorrió el campo entero para celebrarlo ante la grada rival. Acabó multado por la federación inglesa.":"September 2009: Emmanuel Adebayor scored against Arsenal, his former club, and ran the length of the pitch to celebrate in front of the rival fans. He ended up fined by the FA.",
"Septiembre de 2012: Miroslav Klose marcó con la mano ante el Nápoles y se lo confesó al árbitro, que anuló el gol.":"September 2012: Miroslav Klose scored with his hand against Napoli and admitted it to the referee, who disallowed the goal.",
"Ser capitán":"Be captain",
"Ser feliz jugando. Si mañana ganara el mundo entero y no disfrutara, no me serviría de nada.":"Being happy playing. If tomorrow I won the whole world and didn't enjoy it, it'd be worth nothing.",
