"Te ganas a los pesos pesados.":"You win over the big names.",
"Te ganas la segunda amarilla. A la caseta.":"You earn a second yellow. Off you go.",
"Te ganas los pitos de todo el estadio y encima marca.":"You earn the whistles of the whole stadium and he scores anyway.",
