"Te sientas en la rueda de prensa previa y delante tienes dos latas de un refresco azucarado, patrocinador de la competición. Siempre has defendido comer sano.":"You sit down at the pre-match press conference and in front of you are two cans of a sugary soft drink, the competition's sponsor. You've always championed healthy eating.",
