"Yo no he dicho nada ofensivo. He dicho lo que todos piensan. Y a mí me caen las multas por pensar en voz alta.":"I didn't say anything offensive. I said what everyone thinks. And I'm the one fined for thinking out loud.",
"Yo no me creo superior. Soy superior. Y no es arrogancia, es una descripción objetiva.":"I don't think I'm better. I am better. And it's not arrogance, it's an objective description.",
