"El portero del {opp} despejando el balón con el codo en la oscuridad. Ni él sabe cómo 🥅":"The {opp} keeper clearing the ball with her elbow in the dark. Even she doesn't know how 🥅",
"El presidente te invita a cenar y, entre plato y plato, te pregunta qué piensas del míster. Parece que se plantea cambiarlo.":"The president invites you to dinner and, between courses, asks what you think of the manager. He seems to be considering replacing her.",
"El presidente toma nota. Si se entera, el míster te lo agradecerá.":"The president takes note. If she finds out, the manager will be grateful.",
